    notes: >-
      The work triage-pg derives from. Started at the Center for Data Science
      and Public Policy, University of Chicago, and later maintained at
      Carnegie Mellon University; Rayid Ghani originated and led the project.
      triage-pg is a rewrite that keeps the pipeline shape and the timechop
      temporal-splitting component. Authors below follow the upstream
      AUTHORS.rst, with Kasun Amarasinghe and Liliana Millan added — both
      contributed after that file was last updated.
